                                                "sense_id": "ebff96ef-6be4-3e52-9de8-9d8f76d5325f",
                                                "text": "Imagine a testless educational system up through the fifth grade. What effect would that have on children's later performance, or on our ability to prescribe individualized educational programs for them?"
